    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26四川）一批志愿者向灾区背运一批物资。如果每人背20千克，则余下100千克物资；如果每人多背4千克，则还能比原计划多背运5%的物资。问如在原计划基础上增加400千克物资且每人背25千克，至少还需要增加多少名志愿者？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "9"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "11"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "13"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "15"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          37
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          31
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-06-p037.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第31页",
            "pdfPage": 37
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设原志愿者n人、原物资W千克。每人20千克还剩100，W=20n+100；每人24千克则能运原物资的105%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "24n=1.05(20n+100)\\Rightarrow n=35,\\quad W=800"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "新增400千克后要运1200千克，每人25千克，至少1200/25=48人，因此还需增加48-35=13人，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "多运百分比的基准是原物资总量，先求原方案再比较新旧人数。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
