    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-07-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第7题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-07",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25天津）某旅行团有游客15人，租用6辆车外出旅行，每辆车乘坐游客最多4人。已知每辆车至少乘坐1名游客，问乘坐2名游客的车辆至多有几辆？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "2"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "4"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          38
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          32
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-07-p038.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷7 · 讲义第32页",
            "pdfPage": 38
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-07-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-07",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设有k辆车坐2人，则这些车载2k人，其余6-k辆最多各坐4人。要载完15人，必须2k+4(6-k)≥15。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "24-2k\\ge15\\Rightarrow k\\le4"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "取4辆各2人，剩下2辆分别坐3人、4人，正好15人，且每辆1至4人，能够达到，所以最多4辆，选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "最大化某类车辆时，用其余车辆的容量上限作约束，并检查实际分配。"
        }
      ],
