    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26天津）小陈连续6天看一本书，每天看整数页，且每天看的页数都比上一天多。已知前3天看的页数正好是连续的自然数，第6天看的页数等于第4、5天之和，第5天的页数等于第1、2、3天之和。若6天一共看了100页，则第4天看了多少页？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "14"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "15"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "16"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "17"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          38
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          32
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-08-p038.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第32页",
            "pdfPage": 38
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-08-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-08",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设前3天为a、a+1、a+2页，第4天b页。第5天为3a+3，第6天为b+3a+3，总数100页。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "9a+2b+9=100\\Rightarrow b=\\frac{91-9a}{2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "严格递增还要求a+2<b<3a+3。代入得85/15<a<87/11，所以a只能6或7；又91-9a必须为偶数，a只能奇数，故a=7、b=14。核验7、8、9、14、24、38，总和100且严格递增，选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "连续整数与严格递增能补足方程之外的范围、奇偶条件。"
        }
      ],
